            <h1 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-4">Your Safe Left the House. Do You Still Have the Serials?</h1>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mb-6">Two thefts in August 2026, one lesson: a locked safe is not a records plan. Keep a copy of make, model, caliber, and serials that can still reach police the same day.</p>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-400">
